      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/mcgregor-tx",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Route 84 cuts through McGregor’s downtown, linking it 17 miles northeast to Waco and 20 miles west to Gatesville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
